# API Contracts: Dashboard UI Rebuild — Premium Futuristic Redesign

**Feature**: 008-dashboard-ui-redesign | **Date**: 2026-01-24

## Overview

This document defines the API contracts for the dashboard UI interactions. The dashboard maintains all existing backend API contracts while introducing new UI-specific interfaces for enhanced functionality.

## Existing API Contracts (Preserved)

All existing API contracts remain unchanged as per the feature requirements:

### Task Management APIs
```
GET    /api/{user_id}/tasks          - List all tasks
POST   /api/{user_id}/tasks          - Create a new task
GET    /api/{user_id}/tasks/{id}     - Get task details
PUT    /api/{user_id}/tasks/{id}     - Update a task
DELETE /api/{user_id}/tasks/{id}     - Delete a task
PATCH  /api/{user_id}/tasks/{id}/complete - Toggle completion
```

### Authentication APIs
```
POST   /api/auth/login              - User login
POST   /api/auth/logout             - User logout
GET    /api/auth/me                 - Get current user
```

## UI-Specific Contracts

### Dashboard State Management

#### GET /api/{user_id}/dashboard/preferences
Get user-specific dashboard preferences and UI state

**Request**:
```json
{
  "headers": {
    "Authorization": "Bearer {jwt_token}",
    "Content-Type": "application/json"
  }
}
```

**Response (Success - 200)**:
```json
{
  "sidebarCollapsed": false,
  "theme": "futuristic-dark",
  "taskViewMode": "grid", // "grid" | "list"
  "lastVisited": "2026-01-24T10:30:00Z",
  "customizationSettings": {
    "glassIntensity": 0.4,
    "animationSpeed": "normal", // "slow" | "normal" | "fast"
    "scanlineEnabled": true
  }
}
```

**Response (Unauthorized - 401)**:
```json
{
  "error": "Unauthorized",
  "message": "Invalid or expired JWT token"
}
```

#### PUT /api/{user_id}/dashboard/preferences
Update user-specific dashboard preferences

**Request**:
```json
{
  "headers": {
    "Authorization": "Bearer {jwt_token}",
    "Content-Type": "application/json"
  },
  "body": {
    "sidebarCollapsed": true,
    "theme": "futuristic-dark",
    "taskViewMode": "grid",
    "customizationSettings": {
      "glassIntensity": 0.6,
      "animationSpeed": "slow",
      "scanlineEnabled": false
    }
  }
}
```

**Response (Success - 200)**:
```json
{
  "success": true,
  "updatedPreferences": {
    "sidebarCollapsed": true,
    "theme": "futuristic-dark",
    "taskViewMode": "grid",
    "customizationSettings": {
      "glassIntensity": 0.6,
      "animationSpeed": "slow",
      "scanlineEnabled": false
    }
  }
}
```

**Response (Bad Request - 400)**:
```json
{
  "error": "Validation Error",
  "message": "Invalid preference values provided"
}
```

**Response (Unauthorized - 401)**:
```json
{
  "error": "Unauthorized",
  "message": "Invalid or expired JWT token"
}
```

